  "id": "functional-limitation",
  "term": "functional limitation",
  "definition": "Functional limitation is a reduction in a person’s ability to function, especially noted as a major health concern in older adults. In this context, it is understood as being shaped by social and economic factors such as age, social engagement, and economic status, and linked to health inequities.",
